{"gems":{"name":"terret","downloads":4685,"version":"0.1.0","version_created_at":"2026-08-20T13:34:23.079Z","version_downloads":75,"platform":"ruby","authors":"Obie Fernandez","info":"The meta-gem, and the way a Terret is composed. Bundles ship ordered config rows, profiles stack bundles, patches adjust rows by id, and Terret.boot hands the result to the Hames loader -- so which plugins run, in what order, with what config is a question YAML answers rather than Ruby. Ships terret-base (the log, the harness, the model seam, the execution world sandboxed with the network denied, the standard tool roster, and a policy floor that starts closed), the headless profile template, and trt: boot, dump-config, doctor.","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"terret":"config/bundle.yml","homepage_uri":"https://terret.org","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/terret-org/terret/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/terret-org/terret","rubygems_mfa_required":"true"},"yanked":false,"sha":"eea16498493e0d7c264bbee563456110aefc7f73d938555cfa6a72cb8791437b","spec_sha":"de54de74497b0b983b9398e71c733d3ae861f1ce2ecb3787982d50b3521a3353","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/terret","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/terret-0.1.0.gem","homepage_uri":"https://terret.org","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":null,"mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/terret-org/terret","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/terret-org/terret/issues","changelog_uri":null,"funding_uri":null,"dependencies":{"development":[],"runtime":[{"name":"terret-core","requirements":"~> 0.1"},{"name":"terret-exec","requirements":"~> 0.1"},{"name":"terret-openrouter","requirements":"~> 0.1"},{"name":"terret-sandbox-docker","requirements":"~> 0.1"},{"name":"terret-store-sqlite","requirements":"~> 0.1"},{"name":"terret-tools-std","requirements":"~> 0.1"}]}},"vcs_name":"GitHub","ci":1,"github_actions":1,"vcs_uri":"https://github.com/terret-org/terret"}